"text":"ታ ቦርኮካ ታ አፎን ሙሱሳድ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ታ ሞርከቱዋ ኡባ ጋሱዋን ታን አፎጼዳ ድራዉ፥","poem":1},{"text":"ታ አይፊ ጋልጄዳ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ታ አይፊ ደመናን እጼዳ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"መና ጎዳይ ታን ዬክያ ዬኩዋ ስሴዳ ድራዉ፥","poem":1},{"text":"ህንተኖ፥ ኢታ ኦያ ኡባቶ፥","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ገደ ታፐ ሻከትተ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"መና ጎዳይ ታ ዋትዋቱዋ ስሴዳ፤","poem":1},{"text":"መና ጎዳይ ታ ዎሳነ ስሴ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"ታ ሞርከ ኡባቱ ዬላትኖነ ቱጋትኖ።","poem":1},{"text":"ኡንቱንቱ ቆፐናን ዬላቲደ፥ ጉየ ስምኖ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/dwr_ent/PSA/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/dwr_ent/PSA/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/dwr_ent/PSA/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}